5,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,"Since it is the first day, I believe we should all introduce ourselves and observe how everyone reacts. I will start by staying quiet and listening.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Shizue,,"That sounds like a lovely way to begin, Jonathan. I'm just happy to be here with all of you. Let's all try to be honest and kind to one another.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Asuka,,"Honesty is a good goal, but we must remember that some of us are forced to lie. I will be observing everyone's logic and consistency throughout this process.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Kenji,,"I'm ready to help find the werewolf! I'll do my best to figure out who's who, even if I'm a bit clumsy. Let's all work together!","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Shion,,"I agree with Asuka. Kindness is fine, but logic is what will save us. I'll be watching to see who among you is trying too hard to appear innocent.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,"I suppose I should elaborate slightly. I prefer to avoid conflict, but I will contribute my thoughts when I feel they are necessary for the village's safety.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Shizue,,"That is very thoughtful of you, Jonathan. I believe that a gentle approach can often reveal the truth more clearly than a confrontation.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Asuka,,"Gentleness can be a mask, Shizue. While I appreciate your kindness, we cannot let it cloud our judgment when we are looking for a predator among us.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Kenji,,"I think Asuka is right that we have to be careful, but we shouldn't be mean about it! I'll keep my eyes open and try to spot anything weird.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Shion,,"It seems we are already dividing into those who trust emotion and those who trust evidence. I find the tension interesting, but let's see who actually provides something useful.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Jonathan,,I have nothing more to add for now. I will continue to observe the dynamics of this group as we move toward the first night.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Shizue,,I hope we can all sleep peacefully tonight. I'll be praying for everyone's safety.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Asuka,,"I will also remain observant. Since there is no voting today, the most logical course of action is to gather as much baseline information as possible before the first night.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Kenji,,I'll do the same! I'm going to think really hard about everyone's talking styles so I can tell if someone starts acting different tomorrow!,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Shion,,"A reasonable plan, Kenji. I'll be doing the same, though I suspect some of you are already playing a role. I'm looking forward to seeing the cracks appear.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
