31,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"Good morning, everyone. I hope you all rested well, though I suspect the atmosphere will be much heavier now that the first night has passed.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"Good morning, everyone. I feel a bit anxious, but I hope we can all stay calm and support each other as we try to find the truth.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"Let's get straight to the point. Since we have no casualties yet, the focus is entirely on the information we can gather. Does anyone have any insights or suspicions they wish to share?","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"I have something really important to say! I'm the Seer, and I checked Shion last night. He's the werewolf! We have to vote for him!","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Shion,,"That is a very bold claim, Kenji. It's far more likely that a werewolf would fake being the Seer to frame an innocent person. I am simply a villager.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Kenji, claiming the Seer role so early is a risky move. While it could be the truth, it could also be a strategy to force a quick execution. We should consider the possibilities carefully.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"Oh dear, this is quite a shock. Kenji, you seem so sure, but Shion is also very certain. I don't like the idea of accusing someone so quickly without being absolutely sure.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Kenji, if you are the Seer, your information is invaluable. However, @Shion's counter-claim is the standard defense of a werewolf. We must determine who is lying based on their behavior and the risk they are taking.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"I'm not lying! I really did check him, and the result was clear! Why would I lie about being the Seer right away if I were the werewolf? That would just make me a target!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Shion,,"Exactly. By claiming the Seer role immediately, you've made yourself the center of attention. If you are the werewolf, you've successfully shifted the suspicion onto me. It's a classic diversion.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"If we execute Shion and he is innocent, we lose a villager and the werewolf remains. However, if we execute Kenji and he is the werewolf, we win. The risk is high either way.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"I just want us to find the right answer. @Kenji, you're usually so cheerful; are you absolutely certain about what you saw? I don't want to make a mistake.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Jonathan, your logic is flawed. If Kenji is the Seer, executing Shion wins the game immediately. If Kenji is the werewolf, executing him also wins. The only risk is executing Shion if Kenji is the Possessed.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Kenji"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"Exactly! Asuka gets it! I'm not the Possessed, I'm the Seer! Please, everyone, believe me! Shion is the one we need to get rid of right now!","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Shion,,"You are all being led by a child's enthusiasm and Asuka's narrow logic. If I were the werewolf, I would have played a much more subtle game than this. Kenji is simply overacting.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,"I believe we should trust the Seer's claim for now. As Asuka pointed out, the potential reward of ending the game outweighs the risk, provided we are cautious about the Possessed. I will vote for Shion.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Shizue,,"I still feel very uneasy about this, but if everyone else feels it is the right path, I will follow. I truly hope we are making the right choice. I will vote for Shion.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Asuka,,"The logic is sound. If Kenji is the Seer, we win. If he is the Werewolf, we win. The only danger is the Possessed, but Shion's defense is generic. I will vote for Shion.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Kenji,,"Thank you, everyone! I knew you'd see the truth! Let's get rid of the werewolf right now! I'm voting for Shion!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Shion,,"It seems my efforts to appeal to your reason were in vain. You are making a grave mistake, but I will accept this outcome with dignity. I vote for Kenji.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
